    <main class="py-5">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="text-center mb-5">
                <h1 class="display-5 fw-bold">How ToolShare Works</h1>
                <p class="lead text-muted">From listing a tool to getting it back — every step is supervised.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="row g-4 mb-5">
                <div class="col-md-3"><div class="text-center"><div class="rounded-circle bg-primary text-white d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center mb-3" style="width:64px;height:64px;font-size:1.5rem;">1</div><h3 class="h6">List or Find</h3><p class="text-muted small">Owners list tools with specs, photos, and pricing. Borrowers search by category, zone, and distance.</p></div></div>
                <div class="col-md-3"><div class="text-center"><div class="rounded-circle bg-primary text-white d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center mb-3" style="width:64px;height:64px;font-size:1.5rem;">2</div><h3 class="h6">Book & Pay</h3><p class="text-muted small">Choose dates, see the full price breakdown, and pay — the deposit is held in escrow.</p></div></div>
                <div class="col-md-3"><div class="text-center"><div class="rounded-circle bg-primary text-white d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center mb-3" style="width:64px;height:64px;font-size:1.5rem;">3</div><h3 class="h6">QR Handover</h3><p class="text-muted small">Meet at the library desk, scan the QR code, and inspect the tool together.</p></div></div>
                <div class="col-md-3"><div class="text-center"><div class="rounded-circle bg-primary text-white d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center mb-3" style="width:64px;height:64px;font-size:1.5rem;">4</div><h3 class="h6">Return & Rate</h3><p class="text-muted small">Return on time, pass the inspection, and rate your experience. Deposit is released.</p></div></div>
            </div>

            <div class="card shadow-sm">
                <div class="card-body p-4">
                    <h2 class="h4 mb-3">For Borrowers</h2>
                    <ul class="list-unstyled mb-4">
                        <li class="mb-2"><i class="fas fa-check text-success me-2"></i> Search tools by category, price, rating, and distance</li>
                        <li class="mb-2"><i class="fas fa-check text-success me-2"></i> Message owners privately before booking</li>
                        <li class="mb-2"><i class="fas fa-check text-success me-2"></i> Pay securely — deposit held until safe return</li>
                        <li class="mb-2"><i class="fas fa-check text-success me-2"></i> Report damage with photos if needed</li>
                    </ul>
                    <h2 class="h4 mb-3">For Owners</h2>
                    <ul class="list-unstyled mb-0">
                        <li class="mb-2"><i class="fas fa-check text-success me-2"></i> List tools with photos, manuals, and safety info</li>
                        <li class="mb-2"><i class="fas fa-check text-success me-2"></i> Set hourly, daily, and weekly prices</li>
                        <li class="mb-2"><i class="fas fa-check text-success me-2"></i> Receive deposits automatically after safe returns</li>
                        <li class="mb-0"><i class="fas fa-check text-success me-2"></i> Build reputation through borrower ratings</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
